  concept: "Authored objective: Detect the return bridge.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from solved LED current, receiver voltage, and wire topology. voltage
    \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching principle: Bridge measurements
    compare relevant branch conditions and reference points; balance must be verified
    rather than assumed.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that
    this objective is complete."
  analogy: Comparing two scales is useful only when both use compatible reference
    points.
